Vibhīṣaṇa leads armed Lakṣmaṇa into great forest --- Vibhīṣaṇa shows cloud dark Nyagrōdha of spirit offerings --- Unentered Indrajit becomes invisible and binds foes with arrows --- Lakṣmaṇa must destroy him with chariot horses and driver --- Lakṣmaṇa waits stringing wondrous bow as foe appears fire charioted --- Lakṣmaṇa challenges peerless foe to fair battle --- Indrajit reviles uncle as kin betrayer serving low refuge --- Vibhīṣaṇa answers born among cruel yet conduct undemonlike --- Vibhīṣaṇa lists Rāvaṇa ruinous lust pride and sage slaughter --- Vibhīṣaṇa warns nephew cannot enter shrine or escape Lakṣmaṇa alive
